<li><p class='igt' id='i151'><span class='words' id='i151w'><span class="word" id="i151w0">Q'idoghtux</span><span class="word" id="i151w1">xiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i151w2">ngiyix</span><span class="word" id="i151w3">diyiɬ'an</span><span class="word" id="i151w4">luq</span><span class="word" id="i151w5">yan'</span><span class="word" id="i151w6">niɬ'anh</span><span class="word" id="i151w7">eyo</span><span class="word" id="i151w8">axa.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i151g'><span class="gloss" id="i151g0">sometimes</span><span class="gloss" id="i151g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i151g2">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i151g3">she does</span><span class="gloss" id="i151g4">poor</span><span class="gloss" id="i151g5">only</span><span class="gloss" id="i151g6">she looks</span><span class="gloss" id="i151g7">shame</span><span class="gloss" id="i151g8">with</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i151ft'>'Sometimes she only looked at what she was doing, because she was ashamed.'</span></p></li>
