<li><p class='igt' id='i153'><span class='words' id='i153w'><span class="word" id="i153w0">He</span><span class="word" id="i153w1">gan</span><span class="word" id="i153w2">xeɬedz</span><span class="word" id="i153w3">xivaxa xidhu'onh</span><span class="word" id="i153w4">ts'i'a.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i153g'><span class="gloss" id="i153g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i153g1">nothing</span><span class="gloss" id="i153g2">good</span><span class="gloss" id="i153g3">they have</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i153ft'>'They (she and her grandmother) had nothing nice.'</span></p></li>
