<li><p class='igt' id='i159'><span class='words' id='i159w'><span class="word" id="i159w0">Genoq'uth</span><span class="word" id="i159w1">tr'ixinelodi</span><span class="word" id="i159w2">yigixite'otl.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i159g'><span class="gloss" id="i159g0">flatfish</span><span class="gloss" id="i159g1">they brought out</span><span class="gloss" id="i159g2">they started to chew</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i159ft'>'They brought out flatfish and started to chew them.'</span></p></li>
