<li><p class='igt' id='i165'><span class='words' id='i165w'><span class="word" id="i165w0">Ts'an,</span><span class="word" id="i165w1">uxuxuyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i165w2">ngi'in</span><span class="word" id="i165w3">che</span><span class="word" id="i165w4">nonxididhit.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i165g'><span class="gloss" id="i165g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i165g1">suddenly</span><span class="gloss" id="i165g2">over there</span><span class="gloss" id="i165g3">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i165g4">it (time) came again</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i165ft'>'Then all of a sudden something else is happening over there.'</span></p></li>
