<li><p class='igt' id='i176'><span class='words' id='i176w'><span class="word" id="i176w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i176w1">noɬchidl</span><span class="word" id="i176w2">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i176w3">taɬ</span><span class="word" id="i176w4">ghaɬ</span><span class="word" id="i176w5">yiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i176w6">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i176w7">xiyeghelo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i176g'><span class="gloss" id="i176g0">all</span><span class="gloss" id="i176g1">sewing bag</span><span class="gloss" id="i176g2">all</span><span class="gloss" id="i176g3">mat</span><span class="gloss" id="i176g4">rolled up</span><span class="gloss" id="i176g5">also</span><span class="gloss" id="i176g6">all</span><span class="gloss" id="i176g7">he took them into the kashim </span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i176ft'>'He also brought all his sewing bags and his rolled up mats into the kashim.'</span></p></li>
