<li><p class='igt' id='i251'><span class='words' id='i251w'><span class="word" id="i251w0">I wanted</span><span class="word" id="i251w1">itsa'a,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i251w2">ne</span><span class="word" id="i251w3">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i251w4">nontithizriɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i251g'><span class="gloss" id="i251g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i251g1">grandma</span><span class="gloss" id="i251g2">she said</span><span class="gloss" id="i251g3">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i251g4">she started to yell</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i251ft'>'I want my grandma,&quot; she said, and started to holler.'<a href="#n14" class="notelink">14</a></span></p></li>
