<li><p class='igt' id='i257'><span class='words' id='i257w'><span class="word" id="i257w0">&quot;Kula</span><span class="word" id="i257w1">nuq'oɬdaɬin</span><span class="word" id="i257w2">luqye,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i257w3">xiɬne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i257g'><span class="gloss" id="i257g0">poor</span><span class="gloss" id="i257g1">women</span><span class="gloss" id="i257g2">poor pl.</span><span class="gloss" id="i257g3">he said to them</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i257ft'>&quot;'You poor women,&quot; he said to them.</span></p></li>
