<li><p class='igt' id='i830'><span class='words' id='i830w'><span class="word" id="i830w0">Ngiyiggi</span><span class="word" id="i830w1">traɬtth'e</span><span class="word" id="i830w2">xiye</span><span class="word" id="i830w3">axaxiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i830w4">yiggi</span><span class="word" id="i830w5">giggidh</span><span class="word" id="i830w6">xiyolal</span><span class="word" id="i830w7">yuxudz yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i830w8">ngiyiq</span><span class="word" id="i830w9">xiyexiydenthiggit.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i830g'><span class="gloss" id="i830g0">in</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g1">kashim</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g2">in</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g3">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g4">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g5">untanned skin</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g6">which they brought</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g7">all of it</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g8">in</span><span class="gloss" id="i830g9">they started to pile it inside</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i830ft'>'They piled all the stuff they brought in the kashim.'</span></p></li>
